            "quote": "Currently, Scottish Widows does not offer a single multi-asset fund that aligns with your risk rating of 5. To achieve this level of risk, we would need to combine two funds. One of which is entirely invested in money market (cash) holdings. This would effectively leave around 20-30% of your portfolio out of the market. Our goal is to ensure that your entire investment is working for you, so we want to find a solution that keeps 100% of your funds invested in the market."
