            ],
            "quote": "Zurich does not offer risk level 5 funds, so to achieve this profile, a blend of a risk level 7 and a risk level 2 fund has been used. As there are no multi-asset funds available within your risk range, the blend consists of the Managed AP fund (in which you are already invested) and an asset-specific fund, Interest Deposits."
